  "description": "Fuaran.Core.OpStream — append-only hash-chained op stream + deterministic replay + JSONL persistence, generic over an (apply, encode, decode) witness. The highest-genericity core layer; the linear spine the branching-DAG generalisation builds on. FSharp.Core only; Fable-clean on encode and decode alike - the one JSONL scanner (OpStream.Jsonl) is self-contained and runs under both pipelines.",
